  "description": "DESXIJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H101 Ce3 O11,2(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.643-3.764 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.78-102.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C44H101Ce3O11.",
